---
// A dark-only brand (src/brand/brand.json "theme": "dark"): always Starlight's dark theme, whatever the visitor's
// system or a stored choice says. Every colour (callouts, code blocks, badges) then comes from the dark palette.
---
<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
